WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 081. PEOPLE KEEP ASKING. A system may be missing.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
SIGNALS. PRESERVE WORDS + CONTEXT. Do not collapse posts into identities.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
CLASSIFY. SIGNAL ≠ NEED ≠ OPPORTUNITY. Keep hypotheses separate.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
VERIFY. REPETITION. ALTERNATIVES. CONTRADICTIONS. Require human research.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. REPETITION CANNOT PROVE DEMAND. Synthetic posts only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. LISTEN FOR THE MISSING SYSTEM. Then validate it.
